<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Navigator Consultants – Redefining Success</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            color: #333;
        }
        header {
            background: #00274d url('header-image.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 4rem 1rem;
        }
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            padding: 10px 0;
            background-color: #004080;
        }
        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .container {
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .image-section img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            background-color: #00274d;
            color: white;
        }
        form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        input, textarea, button {
            width: 80%;
            padding: 10px;
            margin: 5px 0;
            border: 1px solid #00274d;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        button {
            background-color: #00274d;
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        button:hover {
            background-color: #004080;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Navigator Consultants</h1>
        <p>Redefining Business Success Through Innovation</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#about">About Us</a>
        <a href="#services">Our Services</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact Us</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="container" id="about">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p>At Navigator Consultants, we guide businesses toward sustainable growth through innovative strategies and bold decision-making. Our mission is to empower organizations to overcome complex challenges and redefine success.</p>
        <div class="image-section">
            <img src="about-us.jpg" alt="Our Team">
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="services">
        <h2>Our Services</h2>
        <p>We specialize in delivering high-impact solutions, including:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Business Strategy & Transformation</li>
            <li>Market Analysis & Insights</li>
            <li>Operational Excellence</li>
            <li>Digital Innovation</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="image-section">
            <img src="services.jpg" alt="Our Services">
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Us</h
